Traktor Kontrol S4 Apple Silicon installer
Copyright (C) 2026 the Traktor Kontrol S4 Apple Silicon installer contributors

This repository is the arm64 packaging for macOS: the installer scripts,
Distribution.xml, documentation and build script. It is licensed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2 only (GPL-2.0-only), the same licence as the driver
it packages. The full licence text is in LICENSE.

The installer builds the audio driver and the kernel extension from

    https://github.com/almoretti/s4mk1-revival-macos
    commit 2b0e9875384a9e3658e1c066d175ddc80bbb84c0

and does not modify that source. The corresponding source for those binaries is
published with each release as s4mk1-revival-macos-<commit>.tar.gz, and is also
available from the repository above at the pinned commit.

The built bundles are ad-hoc signed by the installer's post-install scripts
(codesign --sign -) so that macOS accepts them without an Apple Developer ID. That
changes the code signature only; the compiled code is the unmodified upstream build.

The kernel extension publishes the IOKit class names
com_caiaq_driver_TraktorKontrolS4_NIUSBAudioDevice and
com_caiaq_driver_TraktorKontrolS4_NIUSBUserClient. These names are required for
Traktor Pro to bind to the device and are used for interoperability only.
